{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
I [Db]stand amazed [Eb]at the love of [Ab/C]Christ
How [Db]in my place He [Eb]bore the cross and [Ab/C]died
Flowed the [Db]crimson for my [Eb]freedom
Now [Db]I have been baptised into His [Ab/C]death
And [Db]by His glory [Eb]I've been raised [Ab/C]afresh
A new [Db]creation in this [Eb]union
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
In [Db]Him I've finally found [Eb]my [Fm]home
[Db]Forever He’s my [Fm]corner[Eb]stone
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
In [Ab]Christ I'm seated in the [Fm]heavens
I find [Db]joy and peace here in His [Eb]presence
In [Ab]Christ my hope cannot be [Fm]taken
Though the [Db]earth may quake I won't be [Eb]shaken
In [Db]Christ I'm [Eb]seated in the [Ab]heavens
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
When [Db]circumstances [Eb]try to get me [Ab/C]down
And [Db]fighting battles [Eb]run me to the [Ab/C]ground
In Your [Db]mercy You will [Eb]raise me
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus 2}
And [Db]I will rise upon [Eb]Your [Fm]wings
You'll [Db]carry me through [Fm]thick and [Eb]thin
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
If I'm [Ab]blessed, if I'm righteous,
If I'm anything at all,
It's [Fm]because I am in [Eb]Christ
It's [Db]because I am in [Eb]Christ
If I'm [Ab]healed, protected,
If I'm anything at all,
It's [Fm]because I am in [Eb]Christ
It's [Db]because I am in [Ab]Christ
If I'm [Ab]loved, have His favour,
If I'm anything at all,
It's [Fm]because I am in [Eb]Christ
It's [Db]because I am in [Eb]Christ
If I'm [Ab]strong, if I've conquered,
If I'm anything at all,
It's [Fm]because I am in [Eb]Christ
It's [Db]because I [Eb]am in [Ab]Christ
{end_of_bridge}
